							"left": 5072,
							"top": 2368,
							"width": 384,
							"height": 166,
							"text": "Researcher is an interface because different types of users can be researchers: students, teachers and employees. Java does not support multiple class inheritance, so we use interface and composition through ResearchProfile."
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGeNRLg5s0SnY4=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGeCLhd7FU5A/U="
